### Happy path: Create a SURPLUS
POST {{base_url}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "type": "SURPLUS",
  "quantity": 7,
  "quantityRemaining": 2,
  "availableUntil": "2026-10-10",
  "status": "OPEN"
}

### happy path: find by id
GET {{base_url}}

### happy path: find by userId
GET {{base_url}}/1

